Cell["\<\
The skin at 3.5\[Sigma] yields the following ratios to the mean separation in \
a hexagonal grid:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9282430453053274`*^9, 3.928243080970389*^9}, {
  3.928243162952168*^9, 
